    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2858060/extras/6bbcb3dd889817c72c7daa83264bda52.avif?t=1723870161\" width=628 height=182 /></span><br>Late at night, while her parents are away, a disturbing presence creeps in and a red-tinted otherworldly world appears.<br>Emma, a college student, explores the otherworldly house alone.<br>A late-night escape from the other world, where despair and hope intersect, begins.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2858060/extras/d6dd8ea5946e876ada929813bbba7462.avif?t=1723870161\" width=628 height=182 /></span><br>Players will explore from Emma's point of view in an immersive first-person perspective.<br>In the Otherworld, spirits of the dead lurk everywhere and various horrors attack.<br>Players will search for switches hidden in the house and escape from the other world while running from the roaming spirits of the dead.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2858060/extras/3d2f2795c41a622d9dae10c2e66ea130.avif?t=1723870161\" width=628 height=182 /></span><br>Luna's eye has a mysterious ability to see into the other world.<br>The player attempts to escape from the other world using Luna's cues and notes as clues.<br>Will Emma be able to escape from the other world and celebrate her 20th birthday safely?<br><br>*There are two endings, normal and true.<br><br>*About the distribution of live games<br>You are welcome to distribute live games. No advance notice is required.<br>We would appreciate it if you could include the URL of the store page in the summary section.",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2858060/extras/6bbcb3dd889817c72c7daa83264bda52.avif?t=1723870161\" width=628 height=182 /></span><br>Late at night, while her parents are away, a disturbing presence creeps in and a red-tinted otherworldly world appears.<br>Emma, a college student, explores the otherworldly house alone.<br>A late-night escape from the other world, where despair and hope intersect, begins.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2858060/extras/d6dd8ea5946e876ada929813bbba7462.avif?t=1723870161\" width=628 height=182 /></span><br>Players will explore from Emma's point of view in an immersive first-person perspective.<br>In the Otherworld, spirits of the dead lurk everywhere and various horrors attack.<br>Players will search for switches hidden in the house and escape from the other world while running from the roaming spirits of the dead.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2858060/extras/3d2f2795c41a622d9dae10c2e66ea130.avif?t=1723870161\" width=628 height=182 /></span><br>Luna's eye has a mysterious ability to see into the other world.<br>The player attempts to escape from the other world using Luna's cues and notes as clues.<br>Will Emma be able to escape from the other world and celebrate her 20th birthday safely?<br><br>*There are two endings, normal and true.<br><br>*About the distribution of live games<br>You are welcome to distribute live games. No advance notice is required.<br>We would appreciate it if you could include the URL of the store page in the summary section.",
